{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54192","headline":"击瓯赋附歌 · 张曙","name":"击瓯赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江风起兮江楼春，千里万里兮愁杀人。\n楼前芳草兮关山道，江上孤帆兮杨柳津。\n是何贶（《全唐文》作「况」）我兮击拊，眷我兮殷懃。\n（见宋史绳祖《学斋占毕》卷二、《全唐文》卷八二九）（按：史绳祖云此篇「巴州郡楼尚有碑刻，曾祖作巴倅时，曾有墨本藏之家。\n」拟题爲《击瓯赋》。\n杜文澜《古谣谚》卷九二则拟题爲《游巴州东楼歌》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}